<BaseLayout title="Web design and local SEO for businesses" description="We design fast, professional websites and local SEO strategies that help businesses turn searches into calls, messages, and real opportunities." locale="en" path="en">
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Web design + local SEO</span><h1>Your website should do more than look good.<span>It should help you win business.</span></h1><p class="lede">We design fast, clear, professional websites for local businesses. Then we build the SEO structure needed to help the right people find and contact you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:info@quisqueyatech.com?subject=Web%20%2F%20Local%20SEO%20project">Request a proposal</a><a class="btn outline" href="/en/solutions">View services</a></div><div class="notes"><span>Web design and development</span><span>Local SEO</span><span>Dominican Republic + USA</span></div><div class="system-flow"><div class="flow-chip">Strategy</div><div class="flow-chip">Design</div><div class="flow-chip">Local SEO</div><div class="flow-output">More opportunities →</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">A website with a job to do</span><h2>We design around what customers need to find, understand, and do.</h2><p>The website is not the goal. The goal is a digital presence that explains your offer, builds trust, and turns intent into a measurable action.</p></div><div class="grid">{[["Unclear messaging","Organize services, benefits, and calls to action so visitors quickly understand why they should choose you."],["Slow or generic websites","Build a fast, responsive experience aligned with your business identity."],["Weak local visibility","Create an architecture prepared to compete for services, locations, and commercially relevant searches."]].map(([t,p],i)=><article class="card"><div class="icon">0{i+1}</div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Core services</span><h2>A digital foundation designed to grow with your business.</h2><p>Start with a new website, improve an existing one, or build a local growth strategy in phases.</p></div><div class="grid">{[["Web design and development","Fast, accessible Astro websites designed to turn visits into calls, messages, or inquiries.","/en/solutions/web-design"],["Local SEO","Architecture, content, and local signals built around high-intent searches.","/en/solutions/local-seo"],["Maintenance and growth","New pages, measurement, performance, and support so the website keeps improving after launch.","/en/solutions/maintenance"]].map(([t,p,h])=><a class="card" href={h}><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p><p style="margin-top:18px;color:#c2410c;font-weight:800">Explore service →</p></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="container assessment-panel"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Local SEO</span><h2>We do not chase traffic for volume. We target searches that can produce business.</h2><p>We organize pages, content, internal linking, technical performance, and local presence around your services and the markets where you actually compete.</p><div class="actions" style="justify-content:flex-start"><a class="btn" href="/en/solutions/local-seo">Explore local SEO</a><a class="btn outline" href="mailto:info@quisqueyatech.com?subject=Local%20SEO%20project">Discuss my market</a></div></div><div class="voice-card"><strong>Business-focused SEO foundation</strong><ul><li>Priority services and locations</li><li>Page architecture</li><li>Technical SEO and performance</li><li>Google Business Profile and measurement</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2>Understand the business. Design the structure. Build. Measure.</h2></div><div class="steps">{[["01","Discover","Define services, customers, market, competition, and goals."],["02","Architecture","Organize pages, navigation, content, SEO, and conversions."],["03","Design and build","Create the website and connect forms, analytics, and required tools."],["04","Improve","Use real data to decide new pages and optimizations."]].map(([n,t,p])=><div class="step"><strong>{n}</strong><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="container founder"><img src="/team/julio-marte.jpeg" alt="Julio Alberto Marte Balbuena" loading="lazy"/><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Direct attention</span><h2>A technology agency without unnecessary layers.</h2><p>Julio works directly on strategy, web architecture, local SEO, and technical decisions. QuisqueyaTech works from the Dominican Republic with local businesses and international clients.</p><p><strong>Julio Alberto Marte Balbuena</strong><br/>Founder of QuisqueyaTech</p><a class="btn outline" href="/en/about">Learn more</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Enterprise</span><h2>Does your problem go beyond the website?</h2><p>For companies that need operational discovery, automation, AI agents, or integrations, we keep that work inside Enterprise.</p><a class="btn outline" href="/en/enterprise">Explore Enterprise</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark signature-cta"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px;text-align:center"><h2>Build a digital presence with a clear commercial job.</h2><p>Tell us what you sell, where you compete, and what you want the website to produce.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:info@quisqueyatech.com?subject=Web%20%2F%20Local%20SEO%20project">Request a proposal</a><a class="btn outline" href="/en/how-we-work">See how we work</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
